ys avengers and the other says  avengers in game so just because the sam  raimi spider-man says no way home on it  doesn't mean that it's fake it actually  kind of means that it's pretty normal of  them to do and to add to it i actually  did spend some time on the internet  searching for other spider-man that may  look like this one trying to see if  somebody simply took an older spider-man  titan hero series figure and tried to  play it off like it's no way home and to  the best of my research abilities i did  not find this exact figure there are  some that kind of look like it but  clearly aren't also not to mention there  is another box underneath at a much  different angle so if somebody were to  photoshop this it would be like the  greatest photoshopper in the planet it  would be a pretty hard photoshop to do  so i'm actually leaning towards this  being more real than fake especially  because everybody should know that i  truly do believe and have been told that  toby maguire and andrew garfield are  going to be in the film if everybody's  wrong i will be completely and utterly  shocked but it's looking like we won't  have to wait that much longer because as  i mentioned in the beginning it does  seem like we are going to be getting our  first teaser monday or tuesday now  yesterday i told you about a report from  lords of the lombok stating that the  trailer would drop monday at 8 am and  this very well could be the case if that  report is accurate but yesterday a lot  of people who are typically in the know  and report scoops often are all saying  that yes the trailer should be coming on  monday or at the very latest tuesday so  i think this is it everybody i think  that teaser is only a day or two away i  don't think we have to wait that much  longer and in the meantime let me know  what you think about this spider-man no  way home toy league don't forget to like  the video and for live updates you can  always follow me on instagram and  twitter and as alway